<p>The target feels the echoes of all your light and dark damage for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> turns. </p><p></p><p>Light damage slows the target by 0.10% per point of damage dealt for 3 turns, up to a maximum of <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">24%, 33%, 40%, 45%, 50%</acronym> at <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">248, 334, 401, 458, 508</acronym> damage.</p><p>Dark damage creates an effect at the tile for 3 turns which deals <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7%, 10%, 11%, 13%, 15%</acronym> of the damage dealt each turn. It will be refreshed as long as the target continues taking damage from it or another source while Twilit Echoes is active, dealing its remaining damage over the new duration as well as the new damage.</p>